        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >—Don't fall! Take the elevator and head for the goal—</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls x 3D action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over falling holes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in the elevator and ascend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit an obstacle and you'll be thrown back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you might have to start over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various traps: Moving and rotating platforms. A series of difficult spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Only jumping, character control, viewpoint control, and elevator activation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you fall, you might have to start over from the beginning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are actually shortcuts!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Jump: Spacebar Key = Spacebar, Button A, Mouse Left Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Elevator: Key E, Button B, Mouse Right Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- View Control: Mouse, Right Stick</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Development: Third Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ElevatorGirl&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Questions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: There's noise on the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Please change the vertical sync settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: I found a bug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: If you contact us, we may fix it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For distribution guidelines, click &quot;Access the website&quot; on the page.</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >—Don't fall! Take the elevator and head for the goal—</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls x 3D action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over falling holes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in the elevator and ascend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit an obstacle and you'll be thrown back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you might have to start over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various traps: Moving and rotating platforms. A series of difficult spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Only jumping, character control, viewpoint control, and elevator activation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you fall, you might have to start over from the beginning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are actually shortcuts!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Jump: Spacebar Key = Spacebar, Button A, Mouse Left Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Elevator: Key E, Button B, Mouse Right Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- View Control: Mouse, Right Stick</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Development: Third Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ElevatorGirl&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Questions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: There's noise on the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Please change the vertical sync settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: I found a bug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: If you contact us, we may fix it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For distribution guidelines, click &quot;Access the website&quot; on the page.</h2>",
